# Keep build contexts lean + reproducible (applies to every image built from repo root).
.git
**/node_modules
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
*.bundle

# AI-assistant / dev-orchestration artifacts — NEVER ship these inside a delivered image.
**/.omc
**/.claude
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/GEMINI.md
**/.cursor
**/claude-code.mcp.json
**/cursor.mcp.json
